WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.033 --> 00:00:01.468
Our senior international correspondent,

00:00:01.468 --> 00:00:03.103
Sam Kiley, has more for us.

00:00:03.103 --> 00:00:04.037
He's joining us from the war

00:00:04.037 --> 00:00:05.972
zone in eastern Ukraine. Sam.

00:00:05.972 --> 00:00:06.573
I understand

00:00:06.573 --> 00:00:07.874
you spoke to one of these

00:00:07.874 --> 00:00:09.175
Russian fighters.

00:00:09.175 --> 00:00:11.011
What did he tell you

00:00:13.313 --> 00:00:13.780
Yes, Wolf,

00:00:13.780 --> 00:00:15.582
we spoke to a significant group

00:00:15.582 --> 00:00:16.583
of them, actually.

00:00:16.583 --> 00:00:19.319
They conducted a very

00:00:19.319 --> 00:00:20.820
spectacular raid.

00:00:20.820 --> 00:00:21.321
Frankly,

00:00:21.321 --> 00:00:21.721
these are

00:00:21.721 --> 00:00:23.723
two groups of Russian nationals

00:00:23.723 --> 00:00:25.492
fighting inside

00:00:25.492 --> 00:00:27.360
the Ukrainian armed forces.

00:00:27.360 --> 00:00:30.130
Now, rather controversially

00:00:30.130 --> 00:00:31.064
in some quarters,

00:00:31.064 --> 00:00:32.632
they crossed into Russia

00:00:32.632 --> 00:00:35.001
at the beginning of this week, conducted

00:00:35.001 --> 00:00:35.869
a number of raids

00:00:35.869 --> 00:00:36.870
on a number of villages,

00:00:36.870 --> 00:00:39.873
penetrated quite deeply into Russia.

00:00:40.273 --> 00:00:41.041
I mean, relative

00:00:41.041 --> 00:00:42.876
to a small group of people,

00:00:42.876 --> 00:00:43.109
we're

00:00:43.109 --> 00:00:43.676
guessing that

00:00:43.676 --> 00:00:45.178
there were about 50 to 70 or

00:00:45.178 --> 00:00:47.280
so to company strength.

00:00:47.280 --> 00:00:49.049
And then we spoke to them

00:00:49.049 --> 00:00:50.683
just after they came back.

00:00:50.683 --> 00:00:51.518
This is what the leader

00:00:51.518 --> 00:00:52.519
of one of the group said.

00:00:53.520 --> 00:00:54.187
What do you hope

00:00:54.187 --> 00:00:56.256
will be the effect of this raid

00:00:57.157 --> 00:00:58.191
effect of Israel?

00:00:58.191 --> 00:00:59.893
It was amazing.

00:00:59.893 --> 00:01:03.263
It was information of shell

00:01:03.263 --> 00:01:04.964
information, bomb

00:01:04.964 --> 00:01:08.568
blowing about to this whole Internet,

00:01:09.335 --> 00:01:11.304
blowing up the vehicles

00:01:11.304 --> 00:01:12.539
that you took included

00:01:12.539 --> 00:01:14.307
some of the American MRAPs.

00:01:14.307 --> 00:01:16.643
Is that right that you were using?

00:01:17.177 --> 00:01:20.847
We use tell they also we buy them in

00:01:21.581 --> 00:01:23.650
international shops workshops.

00:01:24.451 --> 00:01:25.051
Yeah.

00:01:25.285 --> 00:01:26.319
So you bought these vehicles

00:01:26.319 --> 00:01:28.121
on the open market? Yeah, of course.

00:01:28.121 --> 00:01:30.123
Every everyone who had

00:01:30.123 --> 00:01:32.192
some money can do it.

00:01:34.861 --> 00:01:36.396
Now, these are soldiers

00:01:36.396 --> 00:01:37.630
who are normally fighting

00:01:37.630 --> 00:01:38.364
on the front lines.

00:01:38.364 --> 00:01:40.700
They're part of the Ukrainian forces.

00:01:41.201 --> 00:01:43.503
Some of them have very far right links,

00:01:43.703 --> 00:01:44.938
but all of them

00:01:44.938 --> 00:01:46.005
are dedicated

00:01:46.005 --> 00:01:47.907
to overthrowing Vladimir Putin.

00:01:47.907 --> 00:01:48.241
And I think

00:01:48.241 --> 00:01:49.442
one of the key things about this

00:01:49.442 --> 00:01:50.777
raid, Wolf, is all about

00:01:50.777 --> 00:01:51.711
keeping the Russians

00:01:51.711 --> 00:01:54.981
off-balance trying to provoke

00:01:55.682 --> 00:01:57.016
responses from the Russians,

00:01:57.016 --> 00:01:58.451
probe their weaknesses

00:01:58.451 --> 00:01:59.953
ahead of what is developing

00:01:59.953 --> 00:02:01.754
into a summer offensive

00:02:01.754 --> 00:02:03.289
by the Ukrainians. Wolf.

00:02:03.289 --> 00:02:03.656
All right.

00:02:03.656 --> 00:02:05.291
Sam Kiley, stay safe over there.

00:02:05.291 --> 00:02:06.559
Thank you very much.

00:02:06.559 --> 00:02:07.360
Joining us now,

00:02:07.360 --> 00:02:09.429
the National Security Council coordinator

00:02:09.662 --> 00:02:11.965
for strategic communications, John Kirby.

00:02:12.232 --> 00:02:13.433
John, thanks for joining us.

00:02:13.433 --> 00:02:15.001
How do you respond to that

00:02:15.001 --> 00:02:15.935
Russian fighter

00:02:15.935 --> 00:02:17.070
telling CNN

00:02:17.070 --> 00:02:19.305
they used american-made vehicles

00:02:19.305 --> 00:02:21.074
they say bought on the open market

00:02:21.074 --> 00:02:23.209
in their attack on Russia.

00:02:23.209 --> 00:02:23.943
I certainly can't

00:02:23.943 --> 00:02:25.411
confirm those reports, Wolf,

00:02:25.411 --> 00:02:26.613
the day that he bought these things

00:02:26.613 --> 00:02:28.014
on the open market.

00:02:28.014 --> 00:02:28.982
What I can confirm

00:02:28.982 --> 00:02:29.949
is that we've made it clear

00:02:29.949 --> 00:02:31.351
to the Ukrainians

00:02:31.351 --> 00:02:33.453
that we don't want to see us made U.S.

00:02:33.453 --> 00:02:34.821
supplied equipment

00:02:34.821 --> 00:02:37.524
used on Russian soil to attack Russia.

00:02:37.557 --> 00:02:38.091
What we are

00:02:38.091 --> 00:02:40.160
providing is a lot of equipment,

00:02:40.160 --> 00:02:41.861
tools, training capabilities,

00:02:41.861 --> 00:02:43.530
including weapons systems

00:02:43.530 --> 00:02:45.732
to be used to defend Ukrainian soil.

00:02:45.732 --> 00:02:46.866
And again, we've made that clear.

00:02:46.866 --> 00:02:47.167
In fact,

00:02:47.167 --> 00:02:48.701
we've we've had that discussion

00:02:48.701 --> 00:02:49.736
with the Ukrainians

00:02:49.736 --> 00:02:51.871
as recently over just the last day or so.

00:02:52.105 --> 00:02:52.839
Interesting.

00:02:52.839 --> 00:02:54.807
Sources tell CNN the U.S.

00:02:54.807 --> 00:02:56.009
assesses right now

00:02:56.009 --> 00:02:57.610
that a Ukrainian group,

00:02:57.610 --> 00:02:59.846
a Ukrainian group, may have been behind

00:03:00.046 --> 00:03:02.415
that drone attack on the Kremlin earlier

00:03:02.415 --> 00:03:03.283
this month.

00:03:03.283 --> 00:03:04.951
Is Ukraine ignoring U.S.

00:03:04.951 --> 00:03:05.785
warnings

00:03:05.785 --> 00:03:08.121
against attacking Russian territory?

00:03:08.555 --> 00:03:09.422
We have again,

00:03:09.422 --> 00:03:10.890
made it very clear to the Ukrainians

00:03:10.890 --> 00:03:13.193
what our expectations are about.

00:03:13.193 --> 00:03:14.761
About attacking Russia.

00:03:14.761 --> 00:03:15.929
We don't want to encourage

00:03:15.929 --> 00:03:16.563
or enable that.

00:03:16.563 --> 00:03:17.964
We certainly don't want any U.S.

00:03:17.964 --> 00:03:19.199
made equipment

00:03:19.199 --> 00:03:21.601
used to attack Russian soil.

00:03:21.601 --> 00:03:22.936
And we have gotten assurances

00:03:22.936 --> 00:03:23.703
from the Ukrainians

00:03:23.703 --> 00:03:25.471
that they will respect those wishes.

00:03:25.471 --> 00:03:26.072
Now,

00:03:26.372 --> 00:03:28.508
what groups are operating on their own

00:03:28.942 --> 00:03:29.642
and whether or not

00:03:29.642 --> 00:03:30.410
they are tied

00:03:30.410 --> 00:03:31.744
to the Ukrainian government?

00:03:31.744 --> 00:03:32.512
We just can't say

00:03:32.512 --> 00:03:34.180
and we certainly can't confirm

00:03:34.180 --> 00:03:34.681
the reports

00:03:34.681 --> 00:03:36.482
in that New York Times piece

00:03:36.482 --> 00:03:36.916
about that

00:03:36.916 --> 00:03:39.085
particular attack on the Kremlin.

00:03:39.085 --> 00:03:40.520
We have been very clear

00:03:40.520 --> 00:03:42.255
that we want Ukraine to be able

00:03:42.255 --> 00:03:43.823
to defend its own soil,

00:03:43.823 --> 00:03:45.425
its own territory.

00:03:45.425 --> 00:03:46.292
They have been attacked.

00:03:46.292 --> 00:03:47.026
They have been invaded.

00:03:47.026 --> 00:03:48.328
They have a right to defend themselves.

00:03:48.328 --> 00:03:49.996
But we've also been clear, Wolf,

00:03:49.996 --> 00:03:51.164
that we don't want to see this war

00:03:51.164 --> 00:03:53.199
escalate beyond the devastation

00:03:53.199 --> 00:03:53.833
and the violence

00:03:53.833 --> 00:03:55.368
that it's already visited

00:03:55.368 --> 00:03:56.402
on the Ukrainian people.

00:03:56.402 --> 00:03:58.371
And I think we can all agree that a war

00:03:58.371 --> 00:04:00.206
that still escalates

00:04:00.206 --> 00:04:01.908
particularly involving more

00:04:01.908 --> 00:04:03.543
than just Ukraine and Russia.

00:04:03.543 --> 00:04:04.177
That would be bad

00:04:04.177 --> 00:04:05.411
for not only the Ukrainian people,

00:04:05.411 --> 00:04:06.813
but for the entire continent.

00:04:06.813 --> 00:04:07.714
So what can you tell

00:04:07.714 --> 00:04:08.448
us, John,

00:04:08.448 --> 00:04:10.817
about these most recent conversations

00:04:10.817 --> 00:04:11.251
the U.S.

00:04:11.251 --> 00:04:13.086
had with the Ukrainians,

00:04:13.086 --> 00:04:14.120
that conversation, conversations

00:04:14.120 --> 00:04:15.255
you just mentioned?

00:04:15.255 --> 00:04:18.124
Did you outline potential consequences?

00:04:18.691 --> 00:04:20.059
It wasn't really about

00:04:20.059 --> 00:04:21.294
outlining consequences.

00:04:21.294 --> 00:04:23.696
It was simply a reaffirmation,

00:04:23.696 --> 00:04:25.465
Wolf, of what we have said before,

00:04:25.465 --> 00:04:27.567
that we just don't want to see U.S.

00:04:27.567 --> 00:04:28.301
supplied equipment

00:04:28.301 --> 00:04:30.003
used to attack Russian soil.

00:04:30.003 --> 00:04:30.870
And, you know,

00:04:30.870 --> 00:04:32.672
they recognize that they they

00:04:32.672 --> 00:04:34.641
they they appreciate that

00:04:34.641 --> 00:04:36.242
that there are concerns.

00:04:36.242 --> 00:04:36.843
And again,

00:04:36.843 --> 00:04:38.678
they've given us assurances that

00:04:38.678 --> 00:04:40.179
that they won't do that.

00:04:40.179 --> 00:04:41.114
The infamous

00:04:41.114 --> 00:04:42.749
Wagner mercenary group

00:04:42.749 --> 00:04:45.718
is handing control of back to regular

00:04:45.818 --> 00:04:47.053
Russian troops.

00:04:47.053 --> 00:04:49.155
Does that provide a window for Ukraine

00:04:49.322 --> 00:04:51.758
in its expected counteroffensive?

00:04:51.758 --> 00:04:53.092
Well, I want to be careful here

00:04:53.092 --> 00:04:54.994
not to not to speak to future

00:04:54.994 --> 00:04:57.330
operations for the Ukrainians.

00:04:57.563 --> 00:04:59.165
I'll let them do that.

00:04:59.165 --> 00:05:01.434
But as we've said all along,

00:05:01.434 --> 00:05:03.503
even before the Russians claim

00:05:03.503 --> 00:05:04.604
they had back moved that claim

00:05:04.604 --> 00:05:05.638
that getting back mount

00:05:05.638 --> 00:05:07.473
was going to be a little strategic value

00:05:07.473 --> 00:05:08.441
to the Russians.

00:05:08.441 --> 00:05:10.009
There's really no strategic value

00:05:10.009 --> 00:05:11.577
on that front around Donbas.

00:05:11.577 --> 00:05:13.313
It doesn't really give the Russians

00:05:13.313 --> 00:05:14.681
much in terms of leeway

00:05:14.681 --> 00:05:16.149
or more flexibility.

00:05:16.149 --> 00:05:17.383
The Ukrainians will respond

00:05:17.383 --> 00:05:18.885
and they'll respond appropriately.

00:05:18.885 --> 00:05:20.553
They will conduct this counteroffensive

00:05:20.553 --> 00:05:21.721
on their own terms.

00:05:21.721 --> 00:05:21.988
You know,

00:05:21.988 --> 00:05:23.523
when and where and how they strike.

00:05:23.523 --> 00:05:24.957
They'll make those decisions.

00:05:24.957 --> 00:05:27.026
What we're focused on is making sure

00:05:27.026 --> 00:05:28.628
that as they make those decisions,

00:05:28.628 --> 00:05:30.563
and as they conduct those operations,

00:05:30.563 --> 00:05:30.930
they've got

00:05:30.930 --> 00:05:32.198
all the tools and capabilities

00:05:32.198 --> 00:05:33.700
and the training that they need.

00:05:33.700 --> 00:05:35.268
And we have been in lockstep

00:05:35.268 --> 00:05:36.169
with the Ukrainians

00:05:36.169 --> 00:05:36.803
for months

00:05:36.803 --> 00:05:37.904
now, making sure

00:05:37.904 --> 00:05:39.972
that they have everything they need,

00:05:39.972 --> 00:05:41.307
if and when they want to launch

00:05:41.307 --> 00:05:42.041
a counteroffensive.

00:05:42.041 --> 00:05:43.142
And that includes, Wolf,

00:05:43.142 --> 00:05:44.944
you know, packages of security assistance

00:05:44.944 --> 00:05:45.745
that just got announced

00:05:45.745 --> 00:05:47.313
last week in Hiroshima.

00:05:47.313 --> 00:05:49.682
And I fully anticipate you'll see

00:05:50.049 --> 00:05:50.883
additional security

00:05:50.883 --> 00:05:51.784
assistance packages

00:05:51.784 --> 00:05:54.220
coming in the coming weeks and months.

00:05:54.220 --> 00:05:54.854
John Kirby

00:05:54.854 --> 00:05:56.055
joining us from the White House.

00:05:56.055 --> 00:05:56.723
John, thank you.

